    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Sheep is a 2-10 player online multiplayer social-deduction party game. Players need to blend in with the AI sheep, identify the other real players, and strike before they do!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending In with AI Sheep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in by mimicking AI sheep\u2014move, graze, look around, and act exactly like them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/2fcfd9b7e2d722d56efdeeb5729d7cae.poster.avif?t=1754539535\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/2fcfd9b7e2d722d56efdeeb5729d7cae.webm?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/2fcfd9b7e2d722d56efdeeb5729d7cae.mp4?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt or Be Hunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for weird behaviour, then strike hard\u2014just be cautious, every attack risks blowing your cover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/5fa2cf0b7092291d489e8ccdfc9a1e20.poster.avif?t=1754539535\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/5fa2cf0b7092291d489e8ccdfc9a1e20.webm?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/5fa2cf0b7092291d489e8ccdfc9a1e20.mp4?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mushrooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match, the mushroom colours stay the same but their effects are reshuffled\u2014each colour corresponds to a different buff or debuff, and you\u2019ll need to deduce which does what each game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/30060578f77d5c46fcc09b627f5658fd.poster.avif?t=1754539535\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/30060578f77d5c46fcc09b627f5658fd.webm?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/30060578f77d5c46fcc09b627f5658fd.mp4?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map drops you into a distinct environment\u2014like a forest, farm or meadow\u2014with its own features and cover. You\u2019ll need to adapt  and use the terrain to your advantage.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Sheep is a 2-10 player online multiplayer social-deduction party game. Players need to blend in with the AI sheep, identify the other real players, and strike before they do!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending In with AI Sheep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in by mimicking AI sheep\u2014move, graze, look around, and act exactly like them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/2fcfd9b7e2d722d56efdeeb5729d7cae.poster.avif?t=1754539535\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/2fcfd9b7e2d722d56efdeeb5729d7cae.webm?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/2fcfd9b7e2d722d56efdeeb5729d7cae.mp4?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt or Be Hunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for weird behaviour, then strike hard\u2014just be cautious, every attack risks blowing your cover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/5fa2cf0b7092291d489e8ccdfc9a1e20.poster.avif?t=1754539535\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/5fa2cf0b7092291d489e8ccdfc9a1e20.webm?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/5fa2cf0b7092291d489e8ccdfc9a1e20.mp4?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mushrooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match, the mushroom colours stay the same but their effects are reshuffled\u2014each colour corresponds to a different buff or debuff, and you\u2019ll need to deduce which does what each game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/30060578f77d5c46fcc09b627f5658fd.poster.avif?t=1754539535\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/30060578f77d5c46fcc09b627f5658fd.webm?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207340/extras/30060578f77d5c46fcc09b627f5658fd.mp4?t=1754539535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map drops you into a distinct environment\u2014like a forest, farm or meadow\u2014with its own features and cover. You\u2019ll need to adapt  and use the terrain to your advantage.</p>",
